<metadata><name>Galičica trail G-1</name><desc>G-1 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It runs 4.7 km from the H-4 junction to the T-3 junction, climbing about 193 m and descending 124 m in the direction drawn, between 1,454 m and 1,627 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/g-1/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
